# The forest snail's body (#329, D101, D106): the `dead` frame of snail.grid, pixel for pixel, in a decor-tier
# palette (D76): grey-brown with a contour in its own hue, no ink 0b0814, no moon rim, so the empty shell never reads
# as a live snail. Keep it in step with snail.grid.
size 24 16
color k 5e524a
color o 6e6258
color s 544842
color S 6a5c54
color t 7c6e62
color c 988a7a
color m 4c403c
frame body
